/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 100 0 R
/E (All major energy decisions are evaluated using risk-adjusted metrics such as RAISV, ensuring projects reflect their true long-term cost and vulnerability. Instead of rewarding headline capacity additions, the state shifts to a model where only mathematically viable, risk-priced projects move forward.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
